<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Foods started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Foods started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it started coverage of Dean Foods Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target at $43 per share, or 15.5 times 1998 earnings estimate of $2.40 per share.</p>
<p>-- 1997 earnings estimate is $2.05 per share.</p>
<p>-- Said currnet stock price &quot;fails to recognize ... the earnings upside provided by the company's recent restructuring.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 37-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
